OL,3,GNEWSACommunity asset status for former
OL,4,Amental health hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former mental health centre is to be
OL,7,Fclassed as a community asset following
OL,8,Fa successful bid to the city council.
OL,10,FLeeds City Council agreed to include
OL,11,Fthe Stocks Hill Hub building in Armley
OL,12,Famong its list of Assets of Community
OL,13,FValue (ACVs).
OL,15,FThe Idarah Ansarul Hussain Cultural
OL,16,FCentre charity applied for the right to
OL,17,Ftake over the site on Chapel Lane.
OL,19,FThe status means the organisation would
OL,20,Fbe able to raise funds to buy the
OL,21,Fbuilding if it was put up for sale.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
